ying.\" The genre occasionally uses improvisational additions, twirls and auxiliary sounds. Catchy rhythms, stressed by handclaps and plastic body moves, are an important feature.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "Hasan Raheem", "streams": 18009, "best_position": 49}, {"artist": "Billie Eilish", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Charlie Puth", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Daniel Caesar", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Frank Ocean", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Harry Styles", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Jeff Buckley", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "KATSEYE", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Michael Jackson", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "PARTYNEXTDOOR", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Ravyn Lenae", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Rihanna", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "synth-pop": {"genre": "synth-pop", "country_code": "pk", "country_name": "Pakistan", "summary": "Synth Pop was one of the most distinctive subgenres of new wave. In the early '80s, a number of bands primarily British and heavily influenced Roxy Music and David Bowie adapted the electronic innovations of bands like Kraftwerk for pop songs. Initially, in the hands of artists like Gary Numan, The Human League and Depeche Mode, the sound was eerie, sterile, and vaguely menacing, since the electronics droned on relentlessly without any change in inflections.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "Charli xcx", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Conan Gray", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Dua Lipa", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Harry Styles", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Katy Perry", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Lady Gaga", "streams": null, "best_position": null},